# CODEOWNERS: GitHub asks these people to review any PR that changes matching files.
# To use it: rename to CODEOWNERS and put it in .github/. With a ruleset that requires
# code-owner review, the PR can't merge until one of them approves.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Business rules: money and promo logic need someone who owns those rules
/shop/service.py    @your-org/payments
/shop/repo.py       @your-org/payments

# The CI gate and the agent skills: changes need the people who run the process
/.github/workflows/ @your-org/platform
/.claude/skills/    @your-org/platform
